# Where `npm run install-build` installs the release build.
#
# Copy this file to `.install-target` (no extension change) and put your folder on one line.
# `.install-target` is gitignored: the path is yours, not the repo's.
#
# The folder must already exist — install-build will not create it, because a typo that
# silently makes a new folder is how a build lands somewhere nobody looks.
#
# Windows:
#   D:\games\motor-combat-moba
# macOS / Linux:
#   /home/you/games/motor-combat-moba
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Exactly one path may be left uncommented.

/absolute/path/to/your/install/folder
